      "context": "Following the regulations of the Peking Chamber of Commerce, the table lists the 55 gilds and other organizations belonging to it in 1919, with their member stores, chamber representatives and board representatives.",
      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Rows: 55 gilds plus Total row, as printed; the table starts on p. 461 (nos. 1-8) and ends on p. 462 (nos. 9-55). Dashes in the original are written as an em dash.",
        "Sum check (computed): stores 4337 vs printed 4,597 (does NOT reconcile, short by 260; all digits read confidently, kept as printed); chamber representatives 240 vs printed 270 (does NOT reconcile, short by 30); board representatives 35 vs printed 35.",
        "Row 51 label is printed on two lines (Spinning, Weaving and Dyeing / Shops) with the figures on the second line.",
        "Verified: an independent blind second transcription agreed on every cell; the totals that do not reconcile are as printed."
      ],
